<title>USA: 7th Level Inc plans educational unit.</title>
<headline>7th Level Inc plans educational unit.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multimedia product company 7th Level Inc on Monday said it will create a subsidiary, Kids World Inc, that will focus on educational products.</p>
<p>The unit is expected to be launched in March 1997.</p>
<p>Kids' World will be responsible for both established and future educational product lines, including the internet-based Kids' World online service.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
